{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13600060","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13600060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1360006001:2":{"text":"てんやわんやの末、逃げ出したシレーヌを倒し、他の人たちの協力のもと、なんとか凶暴な「提灯」を檻に戻した。","source_cn":"一通手忙脚乱后，你们击败了逃跑的冥湾美人，并在其他人的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x354147919D646B38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1360006002:0":{"text":"フーキンさん！シレーヌみたいな危険な生き物を提灯にするなんて、何を考えてるんですか！しかもこんな大量に！","source_cn":"呼金！哪有用冥湾美人这么危险的生物做灯笼的！你甚至还养...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF979F4035BF91AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1360006003:0":{"text":"よほっ、だが明かりになるのは確かだろう？ただ、飼育下のシレーヌがここまで凶暴なのは予想外だった……","source_cn":"嚯，至少它们很实用！只是没想到冥湾美人被圈养后会这么凶猛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83F747199BCDFA54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360006004:0":{"text":"ボルスの話では、こいつらは海底で、頭の光源を使って獲物をおびき寄せるそうだ。だから、その光を再現して、海の中でも光る提灯を作ろうと……","source_cn":"波尔斯告诉我，它们在水底时，就是靠头顶的光源吸引猎物，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x533AB1FDC380CAAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360006005:0":{"text":"なのに、こんなことになるとは……ネイト、シレーヌたちをボルスに返しといてくれ。","source_cn":"没想到会出这种事，唉……奈普，你去把这些冥湾美人还给波...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C60347F85E82042","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1360006006:1":{"text":"安心しろ、今回は麻酔もしっかり効いているから、もう暴れたりはしない。しかし、提灯に使う別の安全な材料を考えんとな……","source_cn":"放心，这次我保证它们都先被麻醉了，路上不会再挣脱束缚。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53FC9A37C4022042","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1360006007:1":{"text":"分かりました！今すぐ返してきます！","source_cn":"是！保证完成任务！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DB59BC6D61CC5DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1360006008:0":{"text":"お前さんたちも手伝ってくれてありがとよ！","source_cn":"这次也多亏你们帮忙了，小伙子们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5320A624D9C8EC85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1360006009:1":{"text":"あ、いや、ただのついでだよ。ほら、大事な荷物を「損耗」させちまったじゃないか……そのお詫びだよ。","source_cn":"呃，没有没有，我们就是顺路，顺路那什么，“损耗”一下，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFDFD2F63F9BFFAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1360006010:1":{"text":"そうそう！だから、どうかブラッディ・マリーに通報するのだけは……","source_cn":"是啊是啊，你不把我们举报到血薇帮那里就谢天谢地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F3C3C240EBD29F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1360006011:1":{"text":"ほ、ほかに用がないなら俺たちはもう行くよ。港に戻って荷運びをしないと……","source_cn":"没事的话我们就先走了，港口还有不少货等着搬呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1E010659BEEC680","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1360006012:1":{"text":"うん……","source_cn":"嗯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23AAC61AFA22ED04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1360006013:1":{"text":"布で提灯を作るんだろ？ほれ、1メートル分けてやる。それ以上はやらんぞ！","source_cn":"你们不是要拿彩布做彩灯吗，这一码给你们，再多可没有了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DB5F0D40DBB86BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1360006014:1":{"text":"もう二度と盗みは働くなよ、今度見つけたら、ただじゃおかないからな！","source_cn":"但以后不准再来偷东西，否则再让我撞见，我绝对不会客气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CA8DAAE95E5C227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1360006015:1":{"text":"マ、マジか……！あんたが話の分かる奴だって知ってたら、あんな回りくどいことしなかったのに。","source_cn":"这、这可真是……！早知道你这么心善，我们就不合理“损耗”了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3569B20B0191BC56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","d